{"name": "Myth of Empires: Throne", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/41ebd7ec420605ed4a35ec0470670385.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter a Multi-Civilization Sandbox for Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myth of Empires: Throne is free worldwide. No base game purchase required. Step into vast lands inspired by Zhongzhou, Dongzhou, and Xizhou. Begin from nothing in a living world of dynamic day-night cycles and complex ecosystems as you explore, survive, and build your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow Faster, Establish Your Power Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Season mechanics significantly boost resource production and development efficiency, shortening the early progression phase. Unlock over 1,300 crafting recipes and equipment systems as you rapidly build strongholds and prepare for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tame Creatures and Strengthen Your Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NPCs, horses, and wild beasts can all be trained and raised to become trusted combat and transport companions. Grow your guild through breeding and training as they aid you in exploration, warfare, and long-range expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Over 100 Weapons for Dynamic Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield over a hundred melee weapons alongside siege engines and defensive structures. Coordinate troop formations and tactical cooperation to experience diverse warfare across sieges, field battles, and fortress defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Seasonal Warfare Against Players Worldwide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Servers reset periodically so all players begin from the same starting point. Expand your dominion through County Battles, Fortress Battles, and cross-server expeditions while competing for world dominance through alliances, diplomacy, and war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Myth of Empires: Throne is a free seasonal multiplayer warfare sandbox. Explore vast lands inspired by multiple civilizations, tame creatures, forge powerful weapons, and build your guild. Lead cross-server expeditions, conquer territories, and compete with players worldwide for the ultimate throne!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/e311e00ad9f1a6ce1ee687f367071784a024feb3/header.jpg?t=1782481784", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Strategy", "Sandbox", "Wargame", "Hack and Slash", "Massively Multiplayer"], "developers": "Angela Game", "publishers": "Angela Game", "release_date": "Apr 16, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4510830", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 April 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NsXu7YP2FXU", "first_seen": 1776290400.0, "review_rank": 838}